# This repo is the document root of a public website. It is public on GitHub,
# Pages is enabled, and CNAME points it at fbca.tv, so anything committed here
# is served to anyone who asks for it by name. Credentials must never land in
# this folder. These patterns are a backstop, not the plan: keep tokens
# outside the repo entirely.

# Cloudflare and other API credentials
*Cloudflare*Token*
*cloudflare*token*
*api*token*
*API*Token*
*.token
.env
.env.*

# Keys and certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*

# Deliberately NOT ignored: Word ~$ lock files. Those are wanted in commits.
